// Observables of the LOINC Ontology module without a LOINC code (7)
* $sct-loinc-ontology#871555000 "Detection of ribonucleic acid of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#871559006 "Detection of ribonucleic acid of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 in bronchoalveolar lavage fluid (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#871556004 "Detection of ribonucleic acid of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 in nasopharyngeal swab (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#871557008 "Detection of ribonucleic acid of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 in oropharyngeal swab (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#871558003 "Detection of ribonucleic acid of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 in sputum (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#1269559008 "Detection of ribonucleic acid of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 using microchip real time polymerase chain reaction (observable entity)"
* $sct-loinc-ontology#871560001 "Detection of ribonucleic acid of severe acute respiratory syndrome coronavirus 2 using polymerase chain reaction (observable entity)"
// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118589004 |Threshold (property) (qualifier value)| OR 705057003 |Presence (property) (qualifier value)| OR 118584009 |Presence or identity (property) (qualifier value)|), 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = << 117174000 |Nucleic acid sequence with relative specificity for microorganism (substance)|"
